.venv/
.claude/
runtime/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.zip
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
data/race_officer.db
# Any name with .db in it is a database. Plain "*.db" missed
# race_officer.db.before-v0248-finish-fix, and 75 MB of the club's racing
# was committed in August because of it.
*.db
*.db.*
# SQLite's transient sidecars. They appear and vanish while the app is
# running, which is enough to make `git add -A` fail mid-commit.
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# Saved race video evidence/public clips: large runtime data, backed up via the
# admin Backup page, not source. (Also excluded from release ZIPs.)
data/video_clips/

# ODM start-line tuning workbench (large test frames; detector lives in core/ and deploy/)
odm_frames/

# Tracker vendor material. The protocol and command manuals ARE tracked from v0.269:
# docs/TRACKERS.md cites them throughout -- parameter numbers, sub-command codes, the
# one-minute floor on Queclink reporting -- and a reference whose sources live only on
# somebody's laptop is one that goes stale unchecked. About 20 MB, comparable to
# docs/hardware which is tracked for the same reason, and build_release_zip.py excludes
# the folder by path so the hut's download does not grow.
#
# The vendor *software* stays out: 74 MB of configurator installers, firmware and a COM
# driver. They date quickly, they are re-downloadable from the vendor, and they are not
# documentation. That bulk is what went in by accident in v0.246 and was taken back out
# of history.
docs/Trackers/**/*.zip
docs/Trackers/**/*.exe
docs/Trackers/**/*.msi

# Manufacturer manuals for the hut hardware -- camera, router, weather station,
# Victron power kit, horn relays. They were tracked while this repository was
# private; from v1.000 it is public, and republishing other companies' copyrighted
# documents is not ours to do. They stay on disk in the race office and in the
# club's private archive; they are simply not tracked here.
#
# The club's OWN drawings are tracked, and the two negations below keep them so.
docs/hardware/**/*.pdf
!docs/hardware/wiring/Hut Wiring Diagram - V0.2.pdf
!docs/hardware/horn/Horn Control Box.pdf
